    "created_at": "2020-01-14T06:16:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-14T06:16:45Z",
    "body": "Regarding stable device ids, something for you guys to ponder:\r\n\r\nCurrently I'm implementing a firmware update for a device using web-hid.\r\n\r\n1. You need to click to get auth to connect to the device\r\n2. You send a hid command to put the device into bootloader mode\r\n3. You have to use the chooser to reauth again to reconnect to the device\r\n\r\nI don't know enough about usb/hid etc if there's anything stable for a given device that is the same between application and bootloader mode, but it would be nice if step 3 would work.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
